{
  "tema": 7802,
  "slug": "me-recuerda-a",
  "titulo": "Recordar = to remind (me recuerda a...)",
  "subtitulo": "Ese señor me recuerda a mi papá.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "To remind someone of something: (thing / person) + me / te / le... + recuerda + a + what it reminds of: Esta canción me recuerda a ti. The preposition is a, never de. To remind someone to do something: recordarle a alguien que + subjunctive.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "[subject] + me / te / le... + recuerda",
            "+ a +",
            "[person / thing]"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The **subject** is what does the reminding; **recordar** agrees with it: **estas fotos me recuerdan a mi infancia**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The preposition is **a**, not **de**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Recordarle a alguien que** + subjunctive = _to remind someone to_: **recuérdame que compre leche**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: it reminds me **a** you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Ese señor ==me recuerda a== mi papá. Tiene los mismos ojos.",
              "en": "That man reminds me of my dad. He has the same eyes."
            },
            {
              "es": "La escena de amor ==me recuerda a== nuestra primera cita.",
              "en": "The love scene reminds me of our first date."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los niños jugando en el parque ==nos recordaban a== nuestra infancia.",
              "en": "The kids playing in the park reminded us of our childhood."
            },
            {
              "es": "Esta canción ==me recuerda a== ti.",
              "en": "This song reminds me of you."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Recuérdame que== compre tortillas.",
              "en": "Remind me to buy tortillas."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
